Prompt: Import Feature Specification
Implement an Import feature triggered by an 'Import' button.
The feature must allow uploading Excel (.xlsx) or CSV files directly into the database.
The uploaded file must contain parameters that match the properties defined in the code.
On upload, the system should:
Validate data: If any record has mismatched or invalid data, reject that record.
Insert valid records straight into the database.
Generate a unique ID for each import operation.
Log a timestamp indicating when the import process was completed.
